I now have enough evidence to render my verdict. Let me compile the findings.

The research space around PRMs for code agents has exploded in 2025-2026. I found several critical issues including major omitted competing works (SWE-Shepherd, SWE-TRACE from April 2026), a complete venue mismatch, and a massive resource overshoot relative to the user's constraints.

