cused than SWE-bench.\n\n6. **REALISTIC EVALUATION**: Drop SWE-bench Verified as primary (saturation + contamination concerns). Use DebugBench, CodeContests, and HumanEval+ as primary evaluations, with SWE-bench Verified as a secondary scalability check if compute allows.",
